WEBVTT

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.690
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.760
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:22.450
<b>Saeki</b>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.240
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.810
<i>So how do you feel?</i>

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>Write an essay about your 
current feelings by tomorrow.</i>

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.120
If it weren't for this,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.480
none of this would have happened.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.380
If it weren't...

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.400
for this...

00:00:55.110 --> 00:01:07.920
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:00:55.110 --> 00:01:07.920
<b>Episode 3 of 13</b>

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.750
Come to the library after school again.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.260
Didn't you bury your face in Saeki-san's boobs?!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:58.220
You're a rotten, stinking sicko, aren't you?!

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.220
I'll toss this in the incinerator right now!

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.690
Good morning.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.030
Mom, I don't need any breakfast.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.680
I'm going to school now.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.610
Huh?

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.890
Why? Do you have something to do?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:48.270
No, I just feel like going early today.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.460
Bye.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:56.780
<i>I'll throw it away!</i>

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.320
<i>I should throw it away and end this!</i>

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.490
Hey, you're getting better...

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:05.930
Isn't he sweet?

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.590
And they've got this delicious—

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.020
Ojisan?!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.820
Yes, I'm Ozu.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.530
Ozu Saburo.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.070
He didn't ask for your name.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.070
So what flavor do you like?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.200
Sesame.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.630
Sesame?

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.350
Did the bell ring?

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:38.590
I think so.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.900
We'll be late again today.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:41.340
No biggie.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.050
Kasuga-kun...

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.430
Did you write that essay?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.810
Of course you did.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.660
Come to the library after school again.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.170
Hey, Kasuga!

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:26.130
We'll have an evacuation drill tomorrow, 
so bring your protective hoods.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.400
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.060
<i>There's nowhere for me to run.</i>

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.560
<i>Saeki-san, I...</i>

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.870
<i>I...</i>

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.160
And I have another announcement...

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:53.940
Remember when I said Saeki's gym 
uniform was stolen a few days ago?

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.910
It turns out that

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:01.500
students saw a suspicious man 
after school that day.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:07.170
A man in approximately his thirties, 
with long hair and glasses...

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:07.920
For real?

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:08.620
There you go.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.300
So a pervert did it.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.340
Okay, keep it down.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.780
That's scary!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.780
Keep it down!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:16.430
If you see anyone suspicious, 
alert a teacher at once.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.620
Head straight home after school.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.730
That's all for today.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.400
They'd better catch him fast.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.570
Does that mean he entered our school?

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.570
Gross, what if he tries something with me?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:28.530
Kasuga, this is getting interesting.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:31.570
Kasuga?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.300
Nanako, don't let it get to you.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:22.510
<i>"The Devil holds the strings which move us!</i>

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:28.690
<i>In repugnant things we discover charms;</i>

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:35.240
<i>Every day we descend a 
step further toward Hell,</i>

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:42.450
<i>Without horror, through gloom that stinks."</i>

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.290
Kasuga-kun,

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:09.390
show me your essay.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.430
What is this?

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.040
<i>Flowers of Evil</i>, a poetry 
collection by Baudelaire.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.260
My favorite poetry collection.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.270
This book

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.700
is filled with evil thoughts.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:36.410
A philosophy that the ordinary people 
in this city could never understand.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.330
This embodies my being.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.560
This is my essay.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.120
Shut up, shit-face!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:50.600
I wanted to see everything pent up inside you

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:54.260
released and written down on paper!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.550
Didn't you bury your face in Saeki-san's boobs?!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:01.350
You probably sniffed her uniform 
and rubbed it all over your body!

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.890
You're a rotten, stinking sicko, aren't you?!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.120
What's your problem?!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.630
I don't understand what you're trying to do!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.650
What were you thinking, Nakamura-san?!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.080
Didn't you see how the class reacted?

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.910
What "suspicious man"?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.140
Saeki-san gave me a funny look...

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:23.750
That's not me!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.590
I'm not like that!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:29.890
I didn't rub her uniform over my body!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:33.620
Saeki-san is my muse! My femme fatale!

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.430
My Maria and my Venus for eternity!

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:38.640
And this thing...

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.810
I'll toss this in the incinerator right now!

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:47.190
Get off me!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.310
H-Hey!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.430
Why?

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.110
What is this? Stop it!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.120
S-Stop!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.600
Stop! Wait!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.370
Well?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.600
How do you feel now?

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.430
Kasuga-kun...

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:55.580
I've had this gnawing feeling 
for a very long time...

00:10:56.810 --> 00:11:00.460
Something writhing in my lower half, deep inside,

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:03.430
that makes me want to scream.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.270
That part of me wishes that

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:11.020
everyone in this world would 
turn into shit-eating maggots.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.360
I must be a sicko, too.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:23.910
Too?

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.730
You should feel good about yourself...

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.790
Because you're the only one

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.070
who ever made a contract with me.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:42.670
From now on, you should spend 
every day with me after school!

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:43.890
Got it?

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:54.860
<i>Saeki-san's uniform was clinging to my skin,</i>

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:58.460
<i>exuding an evil scent.</i>

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.030
Hey, Kasuga, wanna drop by 
my place on the way home?

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:17.150
No, I'm busy today...

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:21.020
Man, you haven't been 
hanging out with us lately.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:21.920
Yeah.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.800
Forget it, let's ditch him.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.670
Let's go.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.590
<i>A week's passed.</i>

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:14.560
<i>Nakamura-san and I spend every 
day together after school.</i>

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:22.650
What are you doing?

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.480
W-We can't just stroll around.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:30.080
If someone from school saw us, 
who knows what they'd say?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:31.850
Would that be a problem?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.670
"Would that be a problem?"

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.290
Come on... Hurry up, Kasuga-kun.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.770
Hey, Kasuga-kun...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.580
These days, my hands smell really nice.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.860
Smell them.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:04.970
No thanks.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:13.240
<i>This is the largest river that 
flows through this town.</i>

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.430
<i>I sit here, on the grassy riverbank,</i>

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:22.500
<i>listening to Nakamura-san's random conversation.</i>

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.120
Hey.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.440
It's getting dark...

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.320
Shouldn't we call it a day?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.880
Won't your parents be mad?

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.650
You're always out this late.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:43.970
Give me your hand.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.190
H-Hey...

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.860
I see...

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:02.640
So you've been using this hand

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.700
to rub Saeki-san's uniform all over yourself.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.100
I haven't done anything like that!

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.090
You pervert!

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.140
You have a crush on Saeki-san, right?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.720
What about her do you like?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.360
How did wearing her gym uniform feel?

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.850
Were you turned on?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.380
If you won't write an essay, 
tell me how you felt orally,

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.610
you pervert...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.490
Stop this...

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:27.700
Talk! Talk, you pervert!

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.260
Talk, you pervert!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.780
Seriously, stop this!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.260
Uh, well...

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.910
I think we should go home now...

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.800
It's already dark.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.080
I'll let you go for today.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:14.860
See you tomorrow.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.630
Honestly!

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:31.020
Why do you come home so late every day?

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.330
Sorry.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.280
I was hanging out with Yamada...

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.620
What were you doing that was so important?!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:39.310
We've been waiting to eat 
dinner until you came home!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.200
Now, now, dear.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:44.280
Takao's in middle school now, 
so he should be with his friends.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.330
Oh, please...

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.420
Now, now...

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:51.500
But you should understand that 
your mother worries about you.

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:54.620
Next time, give us a phone call.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.600
Okay...

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:59.330
Now, let's eat dinner.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.500
What am I doing?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:23.460
<i>It still smells like Nakamura-san...</i>

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.540
<i>What is Nakamura-san trying to do?</i>

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:34.360
<i>What kind of guy does she think I am?</i>

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:39.580
<i>But...</i>

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:41.760
<i>That part of me wishes that</i>

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.160
<i>everyone in this world would 
turn into shit-eating maggots.</i>

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:50.660
<i>I have a feeling that Nakamura-san</i>

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.910
<i>feels the same way I do about life.</i>

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.880
<i>I must be a sicko, too.</i>

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.000
<i>No...</i>

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.770
<i>But I'm not a sicko.</i>

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:09.070
<i>My feelings for Saeki-san...</i>

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.050
<i>These feelings</i>

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.570
<i>are utterly pure.</i>

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.250
Kasuga, morning!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.710
Peace!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.910
You're so loud this morning.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.100
Hey, so guess what...

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:34.810
I found this DVD in my brother's room.

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:38.600
You know what I mean, right?

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.700
So? Wanna drop by today?

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.420
I'll pass.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.700
What? Why?

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.750
Come on, Kasuga!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:48.680
You're interrupting my reading!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.640
I can't find it!

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:53.570
It's gone! What do I do, Ai-chan?

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:55.780
What's going on?

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.760
Calm down, Mayu.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:58.840
What's missing?

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.500
M-My lunch money!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:03.230
It was in my locker because 
I forgot to pay yesterday,

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:04.920
and this morning, it was gone!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:05.580
What do I do?

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:09.200
Does that mean...

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:15.210
That someone stole it after school yesterday?

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:16.510
What? No way...

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.510
It hasn't been that long 
since Saeki-san's incident.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.120
Well? Does anyone know anything?

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.020
Hey...

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.640
Maybe it was Nakamura?

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.620
What was that, Yamada?

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.050
Nakamura?

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.070
N-No...

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.680
Nakamura?

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.730
Nakamura, huh?

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.970
Makes sense...

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:44.730
She's definitely suspicious.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.800
I could see her doing this.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:50.870
<i>Hold on...</i>

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.870
<i>Nakamura-san was with me yesterday.</i>

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.720
Hey, Nakamura-san...

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:05.000
What did you do after school yesterday?

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.400
Mayu-mayu's lunch money was stolen.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.430
So what were you doing?

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:15.020
Get out of my way, dipshit.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.400
What?

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.100
W-Wait!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:22.360
I saw you after school yesterday, 
walking back to the classroom!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.420
Huh?

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.200
For real?

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.750
It was you!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.980
It must have been.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.630
You always have been weird...

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:32.580
I don't get why you're always 
moping around alone!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.550
That's why everyone—

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.380
Hey!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:40.840
What is it?

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.380
Nakamura is pretty strange,

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.300
but that doesn't make her guilty of this!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.180
There's no proof!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.170
What's with you, Kasuga?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.910
You should stay in your corner and read!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:00.280
Oh,

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:02.440
don't tell me that

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.150
you have a crush on Nakamura?

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:06.840
What? No way...

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:07.920
For real?

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.600
Dude, Kasuga...

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:12.760
That's sad...

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:14.000
You've gotta be kidding!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.480
Why Nakamura?

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.200
Kasuga's pretty weird himself.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.340
Hold on!

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:22.310
I was just trying to be the voice of reason!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.120
Mayu, let's go tell the teacher.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:50.100
<b>Foreign SF Novels</b>

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:22.800
Why did I say that?

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:27.220
Um, can I say something?

00:23:22.800 --> 00:23:24.870
Let's calm down and think this over.

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:25.910
Why are you grinning like a fool?

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:29.060
I was just trying to be reasonable.

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:27.220
It's creepy.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.290
Kasuga-kun, are you hiding something?

00:23:29.060 --> 00:23:30.970
Aren't you going to greet Nakamura?

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:31.700
What are you smirking about?

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.310
Did she notice?

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:33.670
You owe me an explanation!

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.640
Don't try to make a fool of me.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:36.060
Shithead.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>My hair is waving. 
Oshimi Shuuzou</b>
